i/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\"/><div style=\"border-right: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 100%;width: 50.6%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div><div style=\"border-bottom: 1px dashed white;position: absolute;height: 50%;width: 100%;top: 0px;display: block;\"></div></div><div class=\"minimap_clic\" style=\"width:152px;display:block;text-align:right;font-size:14px\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32190,32292,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (32190, 32292, 7)</a></div></center></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n</div>\n</section>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Personal Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"gender\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Gender</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Male</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"race\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Race</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Human</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"job\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Job</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Artisan<br/>Collector</div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">10.90<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 8, 2015<br/>Winter Update 2015</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: NPCs <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221211090831&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cledwyn_723f8f.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Cledwyn.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Trading tokens! First-class bargains!</li><li>Bespoke armor for all vocations! For the cost of some tokens only!</li><li>Tokens! Bring your tokens!</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Adventurers%27%20Guild\">Adventurer's Guild</a>, near the Reward Chest.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p><b>Cledwyn O'Reilly</b> is a smith by trade, but has a passion for collecting precious stones and metals. He will exchange various armors providing a skill and resistance bonus for 100 <a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Token\">Silver Tokens</a> each, and the same price applies to both addons of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Rift%20Warrior%20Outfits\">Rift Warrior Outfits</a>.<br/>\nHe will also enchant (recharge) certain items for 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Token\">Silver Tokens</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Pendulet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Pendulet_1cc163.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Pendulet,</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Sleep Shawl\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sleep_Shawl_41993c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Sleep Shawl,</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Blister Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Blister_Ring_663bec.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Blister Ring,</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Amulet of Theurgy\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Amulet_of_Theurgy_30fd5b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Amulet of Theurgy,</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ring of Souls (Depleted)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ring_of_Souls_Depleted_faccf0.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Ring of Souls (Depleted),</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Turtle Amulet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Turtle_Amulet_8959a2.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Turtle Amulet.</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Merudri Brooch\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Merudri_Brooch_42d233.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Merudri Brooch.</li></ul>\n<p>Rings from the Primal Set can be recharged for 5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Token\">Silver Tokens</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Spiritthorn Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Spiritthorn_Ring_905ed4.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Spiritthorn Ring,</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Alicorn Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Alicorn_Ring_cb673f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Alicorn Ring,</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Arcanomancer Sigil\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Arcanomancer_Sigil_ab3023.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Arcanomancer Sigil,</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Arboreal Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Arboreal_Ring_3c2acb.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Arboreal Ring.</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Ethereal Ring\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ethereal_Ring_2b79f8.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Ethereal Ring.</li></ul>\n<p>Additionally these can also be recharged for 5 <a href=\"#/wiki/Silver%20Token\">Silver Tokens</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Flamingo Amulet of Valor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flamingo_Amulet_of_Valor_917a03.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Flamingo Amulet of Valor,</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Flamingo Amulet of Precision\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flamingo_Amulet_of_Precision_a4ea93.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Flamingo Amulet of Precision,</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Flamingo Amulet of Destruction\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flamingo_Amulet_of_Destruction_c912e1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Flamingo Amulet of Destruction,</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Flamingo Amulet of Nature\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Flamingo_Amulet_of_Nature_437376.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Flamingo Amulet of Nature,</li>\n<li><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Swan Amulet of Balance\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Swan_Amulet_of_Balance_86ec4e.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Swan Amulet of Balance.</li></ul>\n<p>Cledwyn is the cousin of <a href=\"#/wiki/Yana\">Yana</a>. Unlike him, she collects <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Token\">Gold Tokens</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">This NPC does not buy anything.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sells\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sells\">Sells</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Earthheart Cuirass\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Earthheart_Cuirass_676d03